  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">After the heavy floods in Pakistan the summer 2010 Sida gave - among  other contibutions - 14 million SEk to Save the Children Sweden f&#xf6;r   interventions in water, sanitation, hygiene, shelter, training,       nutrition. The target group is 150 000 children.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Efter &#xf6;versv&#xe4;mningarna i Pakistan sommaren 2010 gav Sida - bland      m&#xe5;nga bidrag - 14 mkr till R&#xe4;dda Barnen f&#xf6;r insatser inom h&#xe4;lsa,      vatten, sanitet, hygien, skydd, utbildning och n&#xe4;ring. M&#xe5;lgruppen &#xe4;r  150 000 barn.</narrative>
  </description>
